Analyze the following customer complaint and determine the appropriate complaint classification.

Customer Complaint:
I had opened a CD XXXX account with XXXX bank here in XXXX ct, They have recently been taken over by M & T bank. I transferred my matured CD to another bank and was charged {$75.00} by M & T for the transfer. That was not in my agreement with the original bank XXXX. What gives them the right to charge me a fee that I did not agree to? Also what control did I have if they decided to charge me {$500.00}
